  "body": "Sunny, private and seriously liveable. Perfectly positioned near the heart of Mairangi Bay, this single-level home offers relaxed family living with an incredible outdoor setting that feels a world away from the everyday.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, dining and living area creates a welcoming hub for family and friends, while a games room area adds flexibility for a kids' zone or home office.\r\n\r\nBut it's the outdoor spaces that really steal the show. The expansive covered deck, complete with all-weather screens, creates a beautiful year-round entertaining space with a relaxed, resort-style feel. Surrounded by lush landscaping, lawn and a paved courtyard, it has a real Bali-inspired vibe - private, leafy and made for long summer afternoons, entertaining and unwinding at home.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n* Single-level 1970s weatherboard and block construction.\r\n* Modern and spacious kitchen.\r\n* Open-plan kitchen, living & dining.\r\n* 3 bedrooms (master with walk-in wardrobe).\r\n* Family bathroom.\r\n* Separate laundry.\r\n* Games room, kids zone or home office, perfect for those who want separate access.\r\n* Large covered deck with all-weather screens.\r\n* Landscaped gardens, lawn and paved courtyard.\r\n* Carport plus additional off-street parking.\r\n* Close to Mairangi Bay Village, beaches, parks and Windsor Park shops.\r\n* Zoned for Mairangi Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Westlake Girls High School and Rangitoto College.\r\n\r\nWith the village, beach, parks, shops and excellent schooling all close by, Mairangi Bay makes everyday living that little bit easier. Add in a home that is sunny, private and ready to enjoy, and you have a combination that is hard to beat. Come and see for yourself.\r\n\r\n\r\n*Some images have been digitally staged.",
